      "heading": "Course Fees and the 10 Percent Test",
      "content": {
        "kind": "items",
        "items": [
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Becoming a virtual assistant in India starts with a narrow set of tasks you can do reliably, such as inbox handling, scheduling, data entry or social posting, and grows through clear packages, a few honest first clients and written processes that let you take on more work."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Pick two or three tasks, do three trial pieces of work, find first clients through people you know and refer to written checklists so quality stays steady."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check current rules and use written agreements."
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "Course Fees and the 10 Percent Test"
